OL,3,GNEWSA103-year-old Wren returns to
OL,4,AWestern Approaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 103-year-old woman who served at
OL,7,FWestern Approaches during World War Two
OL,8,Fhas returned to the Operations Room in
OL,9,FLiverpool for the first time since the
OL,10,Fwar.
OL,12,FJanet Gardner joined the Women's Royal
OL,13,FNaval Service (WRNS) in 1942 and served
OL,14,Ffor three years.
OL,16,FShe worked on secret codes at Western
OL,17,FApproaches, the bunker beneath the
OL,18,Fstreets of Liverpool where the Allies
OL,19,Fran the Battle of the Atlantic against
OL,20,FNazi Germany.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
